OL,3,ASnooker champion Dott told boy to stay
OL,4,Aout while in room with girl, jury told
OL,5,
OL,6,FSnooker player Graeme Dott allegedly
OL,7,Ftold a boy to stay out while he was in
OL,8,Fa room with a girl he is accused of
OL,9,Fabusing.
OL,11,FThe High Court in Glasgow heard that
OL,12,Fthe former world champion is alleged to
OL,13,Fhave become "quite angry" when the
OL,14,Fchild walked in.
OL,16,FDott, 49, is accused of lewd and
OL,17,Flibidinous behaviour towards two
OL,18,Fyoungsters, a girl and a boy, between
OL,19,F1993 and 2010.
OL,21,FDott denies the charges against him.
